				},
				{
					"id": 706720202,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿圆"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720203,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，快看，这里有好大一只大团雀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720204,
					"content": "我可不是团雀，我的名字是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿圆"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720205,
					"content": "哎呀…这么一说，我的名字…连我自己都记不清啦，你们就称呼我阿圆好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿圆"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720206,
					"content": "阿圆，我们以前好像从来没在蒙德看到过你呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720207,
					"content": "在蒙德能见到或许才是奇特之事，实不相瞒，我本来就是自璃月而来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿圆"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720208,
					"content": "唔，是这样呀…可是，阿圆从璃月来到蒙德的猫尾酒馆里是为了什么呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720209,
						706720212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706720209,
					"content": "难道是来买喝的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706720210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706720210,
